      "content": "i know i should talk to them but i cant get an appointment until next week and im barely sleeping bc of this cough. its driving me crazy. i just want to know if taking a standard dose of something like Robitussin or Delsym is actually dangerous or if its just a general warning. like is there a specific reason i shouldn't, or can i just take it to get through the night?",
